[78.708752, "o", "   \u2705 Success: reload tor\r\n\u2705 Tor service ready.\r\n\r\n\u2705 Service 'demo-tor' stopped successfully!\r\n   \u2139\ufe0f  Use 'enola-cli tor start demo-tor' to restart it.\r\n\u2705 Service 'demo-tor' stopped\r\n"]
