[85.877653, "o", "   tor status: active\r\n   \u2699\ufe0f  Trying: systemctl reload tor...\r\n"]
[85.892354, "o", "   \u2705 Success: reload tor\r\n\u2705 Tor service ready.\r\n\u2705 Service 'demo-tor' removed\r\n"]
[85.893988, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32m\u001b[1m\u2705 Demo completa \u2014 servicio creado y eliminado correctamente.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
